<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Egoli consolidates capital, buys snack firm.</title>
<headline>Egoli consolidates capital, buys snack firm.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egoli Consolidated Mines Ltd said on Monday it would consolidate its issued share capital on the basis of one new consolidated Egoli share for every 25 held.</p>
<p>The company also announced it had agreed to buy confectionery and snack food firm Collondale Consumer Products (Pty) Ltd for 57.46 million rand, to be settled via the issue of 50.8 million new shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
